---flipped\_shadow\_running\_with\_gun must be nil or contain exactly 18 directions, so all of the combination of gun direction and moving direction can be covered. Some of these variations are used in reverse to save space. You can use the character animation in the base game for reference. `flipped_shadow_running_with_gun` has to have same frame count as `running_with_gun`.
